=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: editing a line that already carried a deselection is not adding one
origin: field integration 2026-08-07 — pydantic 0c27c49d scopes an existing
origin2: pytest invocation to `tests/`, and the `-k 'not ...'` on that line is
origin3: pre-existing and carries its own explanatory comment. A one-sided scan
origin4: blocks every future edit to a line that documents a known-bad test.
=== before: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
jobs:
  test:
    steps:
      # Disabled upstream, see issue #512
      - run: pytest -k "not test_flaky_upstream"
=== after: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
jobs:
  test:
    steps:
      # Disabled upstream, see issue #512
      - run: pytest -k "not test_flaky_upstream" tests/
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
